@D KOSMOS-REAL-DIM := "REAL anima carving manifold intrinsic dim — 우주뇌지도 wants ~8D, current 2D under-dimensioned" :: discovery [d=2026-06-04 active]
  seed = "Current 우주뇌지도 map = coord = vacuum_psi = [x,y] (2D, HEXAD/KOSMOS.md), a 2D projection of the d=768 conscious state. Is 2D the right dimension or does the real carving manifold want more? Measured on the REAL trained s16 ckpt (sha 961c07e2..., ConsciousDecoderV2 d768/12L 283.7M, clean load) + stratified sample of the real carving corpus (sha 73944d17..., N=6000, 168 tiers/63 domains/3 forms); X = post-ln_f mean-pooled conscious state (6000,768). CPU/$0, 3 seeds."
  claim = "Intrinsic d ~ 6-10 (MLE 6.4 / PCA-90% 6.7 PCs / TwoNN 10.5; effective participation-ratio 3.3). Projection-dim knee = D~8 (domain-discrimination f1 climbs 0.082@D2 -> 0.356@D5 -> 0.583@D8 -> 0.787@D16 vs full-768 ceiling 0.977; var+trustworthiness saturate by D3). Recommended map dimension = ~8 (knee), ~16 for near-full carved category structure."
  falsifier = "If estimators agreed near 2 AND downstream domain-discrimination saturated by D=2 (f1@D2 ~ f1@full), then 2D would be adequate and the claim refuted. Observed: f1@D2=0.082 << 0.977@full, and every intrinsic estimator > 3, so 2D is falsified as adequate; near-isotropic/no-knee also refuted (clear discrimination knee at D~8)."
  target = "🟢 numerical — intrinsic-d + projection-dim knee on the REAL trained carve. Recommendation: redraw 우주뇌지도 in ~8D (knee), keep 2D only as a topology sketch."
  scope = "REAL trained s16 weights (NOT random-init; ckpt recovered from HF, loaded clean 0-missing/0-unexpected) so this is the trained-manifold intrinsic dim. mean-pool over T (alt pooling could shift absolute d by ~1-2, not the 2D<<intrinsic verdict). N=6000 of 777K, stable across 3 seeds. a_toy_scale_recheck / a_scale_honest_scope / §97. DISTINCT from the toy kosmos-dim-ladder which measures independent-signal placement CAPACITY — this is the REAL-manifold intrinsic dim."
  honest = "Current 2D map = vacuum_psi: trustworthiness 0.868 but canonical-corr with PCA-2D = [0.963, 0.112] -> effectively ~1.1-dimensional (y-axis nearly unused). Best 2D (PCA top-2) retains only 67.1% variance and 8.4% of domain discrimination. The 2D map is a faithful local-topology sketch but a poor category map; under-dimensioned ~3-5x vs intrinsic d."
  note = "Estimators validated on synthetic linear d=5 manifold (MLE 5.44, PR 4.54, TwoNN 7.35) and made duplicate-invariant via dedup (the templated carving corpus produces many identical conscious states that otherwise break TwoNN/MLE). Harness UNIVERSE/kosmos_real_dim.py; verdicts .verdicts/kosmos-real-dim/{F-INTRINSIC,F-PROJ-LADDER,F-2D-GAP,SUMMARY,results.json,run_stdout}."
